@startuml
title Reliable Task v1 完整状态机

[*] --> READY : submit

READY --> RUNNING : due + CAS claim
RETRY_WAIT --> RUNNING : due + CAS claim
WAIT_RECONCILE --> RUNNING : due + CAS claim
RUNNING --> RUNNING : lease expired + takeover

RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED : SUCCESS
RUNNING --> RETRY_WAIT : RETRY + attempts remain
RUNNING --> WAIT_RECONCILE : RECONCILE + attempts remain
RUNNING --> MANUAL : MANUAL / missing handler
RUNNING --> DEAD : DEAD / max attempts
MANUAL --> READY : admin requeue(version CAS)
DEAD --> READY : admin requeue(version CAS)
READY --> CANCELLED : admin cancel(version CAS)
RETRY_WAIT --> CANCELLED : admin cancel(version CAS)
WAIT_RECONCILE --> CANCELLED : admin cancel(version CAS)
MANUAL --> CANCELLED : admin cancel(version CAS)

SUCCEEDED --> [*]
DEAD --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of RUNNING
owner_id + lease_until + version
所有完成更新都校验 owner/version
end note

note right of MANUAL
v1 停止自动扫描；
后续管理 API 可重新入队或取消
end note
@enduml
